OCPARTICLE 2
NAME Rising Embers
# Wave 10 demo: a GPU emitter (4096 particles is over the Auto threshold of 2048) of additive embers drifting up through curl noise,
# colour and size over life from curves. Procedural dot sprites, no texture. Embers are their own light, so they ignore ambient.
PARAM Heat float 80
EMITTER Embers
SIM auto
SHAPE disc 120 shell
BLEND additive
EMISSION 260 0 4096
LIFETIME 3 6
DIRECTION 0 0 1 20
SPEED 40 90
GRAVITY 0 0 20
DAMPING 0.25
SIZE 3 1
SIZECURVE 0 1.2 0.15 3 0.7 2 1 0
COLORCURVE 0 1 0.85 0.4 0 0.15 1 0.55 0.15 1 0.7 1 0.25 0.05 0.9 1 0.3 0.1 0.02 0
SPRITE camera
SORT none
FOG on
GI off
LIGHTING unlit
BOUNDS 900
CULL 6000
MODULE spawn.sizescale min=0.6 max=1.6
MODULE update.curlnoise freq=0.012 strength=@Heat.x scroll=0.3 octaves=2 seed=7
MODULE update.drag k=0.1
